{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方第一块超大号白字与紫色强调词，首先落在“忘了藏好喜欢”“看出他有多在乎”；随后第二块同样醒目的大字吸引视线。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"一个人藏着喜欢，对方如今看出了他有多在乎。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"不安、失落、担心被嫌太黏；第一眼能看到部分情绪，但不一定能明确抓住完整感受。\",\n  \"missed\": \"被看出喜欢之后，原本的亲近反而让他感到空落落、不知如何相处，甚至觉得两人之间隔了一层；另外，幸福是否真实的疑问和最后的松弛感也不容易第一眼获取。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"两块字号、亮度和强调程度都很高的大字争夺主视线。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在两块里：第一块交代喜欢被看出来，第二块才交代由此产生的失落和不安，需要拼接才能理解完整关系。\",\n    \"第二块单块较长，包含空落落、不知怎么相处、怕被嫌太黏、亲近像隔了一层等多个层次。\",\n    \"放大的关键词虽然能分别提示处境和感受，但不能单独交代两者之间的因果关系。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b11fa903-2000-4b5e-9fed-a0daf5a54f64", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T012037977681Z", "elapsed_seconds": 26.625, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:21:04.603412+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "f247cdd1ba37c1e6cee460118fed0f85fac47190ec55a7d2146f421c77f1352c", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3